[K
Blue is a primary color of light, sitting between green and violet on the visible spectrum. It is the color of a clear daytime sky and deep water, both caused by the way air and water scatter light.[K
[K
Why People Like It[15;1H- Blue is the most commonly named favorite color in surveys around the world.
- It is often associated with calm, trust, and reliability, which is why many banks and tech companies use it in their branding.
- Blue pigments were once rare and costly, so ultramarine paint was historically reserved for important subjects in art.
